{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20214","headline":"悼吴兴汤衡评事 · 孟郊","name":"悼吴兴汤衡评事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君生霅水清，君殁霅水浑。\n空令骨肉情，哭得白日昏。\n大夜不复晓，古松长闭门。\n琴弦绿水绝，诗句青山存。\n昔爲芳春颜，今爲荒草根。\n独问冥冥理，先儒未曾言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20214.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20214","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}